     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><div>I installed R and Rapache in Ubuntu system. But i am unable to do the same program what you told in Helloworld video.</div><div><br></div><div>R code in html tags not executing. it is displaying as normal text with &lt;% -- some R code --%&gt;. i did not mention any file extension i just saved as helloworld. </div><div><br></div><div>html and R code individually executing fine.  but when i written R code in between html tags it&#39;s not executing. </div><div><br></div><div>R and Rapache is enough ? or anything i need to install in my machine?...</div><div><br></div><div>my r.conf file contains the fallowing code:</div><div><br></div><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">&lt;Location /R&gt;</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">ROutputErrors</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">SetHandler r-script</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">RHandler sys.source</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">&lt;Location /RApacheInfo&gt;</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">SetHandler r-info</span><br style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;margin:0px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\"><div><span style=\"line-height:14.734375px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;Corier New&#39;,monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;</span></div><div><br></div><div>and my files are in <b>var/www/R/  </b>folder.  i am accessing them as <b>localhost/R/hellowrold </b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div>Please help me is there anything wrong or any other things need to install and configuration. </div><div><br></div><div>Regards</div><div style=\"outline:none;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;width:22px\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hide expanded content\" style=\"background-color:rgb(241,241,241);border:1px solid rgb(221,221,221);clear:both;line-height:6px;outline:none;width:20px\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/I0X05dDxpDvv2rZpMXlrbmy24gZg77zu4Ql_7IKBPSrx-X15wEW4wTvVyc1P_o0T288Up2W6ABQRpBfIURT0ddk8oH5yQCA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/images/cleardot.gif\" style=\"background-image:url(https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/WqzxozzKp2UsMOyJ9TeAP8VyvxEGIRSYkd2LU-eoxi4elZdCQkJ7nJ0vRTgoEbLm9B7bXKhOhbxlE-EXjoZRMgzh_k2GMJ71=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ssl.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/ellipsis.png);min-height:8px;opacity:0.3;width:20px;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:no-repeat no-repeat\"></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">Suresh.N</font></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(80,0,80)\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div></div></div></div></div>"
